00:06:34,285 --> 00:06:40,285
The extraordinary and unfinished life of Anton Yelchin

2
00:13:08,571 --> 00:13:14,571
Love, Antosha is a documentary film directed by Garret Price.

3
00:19:42,857 --> 00:19:48,857
From a prolific career in film and television, Anton
Yelchin left an indelible legacy as an actor.

4
00:26:17,142 --> 00:26:23,142
Through his journals and other writings, his photography, the original music he wrote, and interviews with his family, friends,
and colleagues, this film looks not just at Anton's impressive career, but at a broader portrait of the man.

