9
00:59:08,571 --> 00:59:14,571
Self, played by Jennifer Lawrence.

10
01:05:42,857 --> 01:05:48,857
Self, played by Chris Pine.

11
01:12:17,142 --> 01:12:23,142
Love, Antosha is a 2019 American documentary film directed and produced by Garret
Price, focusing on the life and career of actor Anton Yelchin.

12
01:18:51,428 --> 01:18:57,428
The film premiered in the Doc Premieres category at the 2019
Sundance Film Festival on January 28, 2019.

13
01:25:25,714 --> 01:25:31,714
The film was released by Lurker Productions in New
York and Los Angeles in August 2019.
